い。ふたりを妹のように思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あなたのこと、気に入っちゃった。ベッドの中で日本語教えてくれると……嬉しいな」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【民族衣装】フラメンコ・ドレス"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒターナ地方の女性の、バタと呼ばれるドレスが起源と言われる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伝統的衣装ではあるが、流行により様々にデザインが変化するのも魅力のひとつ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"140499"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18616","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18616","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18616","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eef5b0761126fa5c3cb703253bf08d1cb0cadd3f2ae1496ad0f219dfc2882ff6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab64b54480d4782cfc73efd4b5f23a86f5d4e8236a7b65bc11f84e38232ff738.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:75354:140499:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25694","characterName":"レイラ ディーリアス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"140500","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"75354"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18617"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25694"},"originalCharacterName":"レイラ ディーリアス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヨーロッパ館のガールズ・ガイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貴族（公爵）のご令嬢で、高飛車で自己中、どこまでも傲慢で人を見下すタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回のフェスタ参加は、絶対的立場の父親からの命令。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人にとっては非常に不本意なガールズ・ガイドでの参加で、本当は、極東の島国なんか来たくなかったため、不機嫌極まりない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このわたくしが、あなたのためにヨーロッパ館を案内してあげましょう。光栄に思いなさい」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18617","sourceWorkId":"10551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヨーロッパ館のガールズ・ガイド。貴族のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本に来ているのは絶対的立場の父親の命令。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親に反発したい気持ちをグッと押さえ、非常に不本意に思いつつガールズ・ガイドを勤めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中央アジア館のファティマと仲が良い。レイラの話を真剣に聞いてくれて、いい話し相手だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このわたくしが、あなたのためにヨーロッパ館を案内してあげましょう。光栄に思いなさい」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【民族衣装】オハラ・ドレス"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中世ヨーロッパ、貴族社会で広まったドレス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆったりと広がる裾が特徴的。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"140500"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18617","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18617","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18617","sourceWorkId":"10551","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d775449f50461962277b4b60321b376af9db56ee806a7fc9a586537937facb41.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4c0cb00617b1998d42d7ed72dbe154ca428e37c029bee05531f8820df20872f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:75354:140500:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25695","characterName":"白山 悠里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"140503","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"75354"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18618"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25695"},"originalCharacterName":"白山 悠里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東アジア館のガールズ・ガイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表向きは、物腰穏やかで親しみのある雰囲気を持ち、笑みを絶やさない大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、裏には非常に嫉妬深い顔を持ち、自分の幸せを何より優先する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「白山財閥」の令嬢で、すでに伊座凪の毒に犯され、堕とされた女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊座凪に全てを捧げていて、今回のフェスタでも各国美女の凌辱に協力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「伊座凪さまと結婚するためなら……他の女の人生、何人狂わせてもかまやしませんえ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18618","sourceWorkId":"10551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東アジア館のガールズ・ガイド。白山財閥のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊座凪のパートナーにして共犯者、そして許嫁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は穏やかな立ち振る舞いと柔らかい言葉遣いで、おっとりした雰囲気をかもし出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがその仮面の裏には異常なほど嫉妬深く、彼女自身の幸せのためならどんな犠牲もいとわない本性が隠されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「伊座凪さまと結婚するためなら……他の女の人生、何人狂わせてもかまやしませんえ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【民族衣装】振袖"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"袖の長い着物で、未婚女性が着用するもっとも格式の高い着物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"江戸初期の